The intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.

