The intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.

